{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36274","headline":"题故人废宅二首 二 · 方干","name":"题故人废宅二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒莎野树入荒庭，风雨萧萧不掩扃。\n旧径已知无孟竹，前溪应不浸荀星。\n精灵消散归寥廓，功业传留在志铭。\n薄暮停车更凄怆，山阳隣笛若爲听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}